---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'How Home Watch Works | Suncoast Home Check — Tampa Bay';
const description =
  'How Suncoast Home Check works: scheduled visits, a full interior-and-exterior checklist, and a dated photo report after every check on your Tampa Bay home, townhome, or condo.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonical="/how-it-works/">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <img src="/assets/hero.jpg" alt="Sunny Florida coastal home watched by Suncoast Home Check" />
    <div class="scrim"></div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">How It Works</p>
      <h1>A careful check, every visit — and proof it happened.</h1>
      <div class="gold-line"></div>
      <p class="intro">Scheduled home watch for second homes, townhomes, and condos across Tampa Bay, with a dated photo report you can rely on from anywhere.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow">The process</p>
      <h2>Simple, consistent, and documented.</h2>
      <p>From the first walkthrough to every report that follows, home watch with Suncoast is built to be dependable and easy for owners who live elsewhere.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><h3>We get to know your home</h3><p>A quick onboarding walkthrough — the layout, the systems, your alarm and access details, emergency contacts, and any specific concerns for your home, townhome, or condo.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><h3>We visit on a schedule</h3><p>Every-other-week or weekly, depending on your plan, plus priority pre- and post-storm visits during hurricane season. You always know your home is on a regular rotation.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="num"></div><h3>You get a dated report</h3><p>After each visit you receive a time-stamped photo report the same day. If anything looks off, you hear from us right away with photos and a recommended next step.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section band"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we check on every visit</p>
      <h2>A thorough walk-through, inside and out.</h2>
      <p>The same checklist every time, so nothing gets missed between visits — whether it's a single-family home, a townhome, or a beachfront condo.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>Full interior walk-through, room by room</li>
      <li>Exterior and grounds inspection</li>
      <li>Run faucets and flush toilets to keep traps sealed</li>
      <li>Check under sinks, around water heaters, and ceilings for leaks</li>
      <li>Look for moisture, musty odors, and early signs of mold</li>
      <li>Confirm AC is running and thermostat and humidity are in range</li>
      <li>Verify all doors and windows are locked and secure</li>
      <li>Check for signs of entry, pests, or vandalism</li>
      <li>Inspect for storm, wind, and roof or ceiling damage</li>
      <li>Confirm the refrigerator and key appliances are working</li>
      <li>Collect mail, packages, and flyers so the home never looks empty</li>
      <li>Reset or report tripped breakers, GFCIs, and alarm faults</li>
    </ul>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="about">
    <img src="/assets/condos.jpg" alt="Dated photo report on homes, townhomes, and condos across Tampa Bay" style="width:100%;object-fit:cover;aspect-ratio:16/11" />
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The dated photo report</p>
      <h2>You see exactly what we saw.</h2>
      <div class="gold-line"></div>
      <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--slate);margin-bottom:14px">After every visit you receive a clear, time-stamped report with photos from around your property — not a checkbox, but real proof of the condition of your home that day.</p>
      <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--slate)">That documentation is peace of mind for you, useful for your insurer, and — if you're selling a home you don't live in — proof of care for buyers and agents. If we find a problem, you get the photos and a recommended next step immediately.</p>
    </div>
  </div></div></section>

  <div class="inline-cta">
    <h2>Ready to put your Florida home on a schedule?</h2>
    <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact/">Get a Free Quote</a>
    <a class="btn btn-navy" href="/plans/">See Plans</a>
  </div>
</Base>
